Package: epidemiologicasuite
Title: Sample Size and Power Calculator for Study Design
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Mukul", "Maheshwari", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
    email = "ryan00700@gmail.com")
Description: A 'shiny' application that helps choose a study design and
    calculates the sample size or power for about 150 designs (proportions,
    means, diagnostic accuracy, agreement, observational studies, clinical
    trials, survival, prediction models, general statistical tests and more).
    Every calculator shows its formula, a worked example and a citable source,
    and results can be exported as a methods-section paragraph, CSV, JSON,
    BibTeX or RIS. Calculations are closed-form or simulation-based and are
    cross-checked against established R packages.
